    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Righteous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I plead with thee: yet let me talk with thee of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "judgments: Wherefore doth the way of the wicked prosper?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wherefore",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are all they happy that deal very treacherously?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast planted them, yea, they have taken root: they grow, yea, they bring forth fruit: thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "near in their mouth, and far from their reins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thou, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", knowest me: thou hast seen me, and tried mine heart toward thee: pull them out like sheep for the slaughter, and prepare them for the day of slaughter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How long shall the land mourn, and the herbs of every field wither, for the wickedness of them that dwell therein? the beasts are consumed, and the birds; because they said, He shall not see our last end.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If thou hast run with the footmen, and they have wearied thee, then how canst thou contend with horses? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the land of peace,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wherein",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou trustedst,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they wearied thee",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", then how wilt thou do in the swelling of Jordan?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For even thy brethren, and the house of thy father, even they have dealt treacherously with thee; yea, they have called a multitude after thee: believe them not, though they speak fair words unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I have forsaken mine house, I have left mine heritage; I have given the dearly beloved of my soul into the hand of her enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mine heritage is unto me as a lion in the forest; it crieth out against me: therefore have I hated it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mine heritage",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a speckled bird, the birds round about",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against her; come ye, assemble all the beasts of the field, come to devour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many pastors have destroyed my vineyard, they have trodden my portion under foot, they have made my pleasant portion a desolate wilderness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have made it desolate,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "desolate it mourneth unto me; the whole land is made desolate, because no man layeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The spoilers are come upon all high places through the wilderness: for the sword of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall devour from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "end of the land even to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "other",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "end of the land: no flesh shall have peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have sown wheat, but shall reap thorns: they have put themselves to pain,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall not profit: and they shall be ashamed of your revenues because of the fierce anger of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.12.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.12.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against all mine evil neighbours, that touch the inheritance which I have caused my people Israel to inherit; Behold, I will pluck them out of their land, and pluck out the house of Judah from among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
